      "content": "oh god help my son is wheezing so bad right now like his chest is moving weird when he breaths and he sounds like a whistle. he has his albuterol inhaler but he only took 2 puffs and it isnt doing anything. can i just give him like 6 or 8 puffs all at once to get it to work faster?? im panicking",
